    10144     define variable vartype     as character no-undo.
    10145     do transaction on error undo, return error return-value :
    10146       assign frame d-inv-doc
    10147         varinvclcasol
    10148       .
    10149       if varinvclcasol = yes then do:
    10150         message "Вы хотите рассчитать суммы по документу?" skip
    10151                 "В дальнейшем суммы будут пересчитываться при каждом изменении в документе."
    10152         view-as alert-box question buttons yes-no update varlog.
    10153         if varlog = yes then do:
    10154   if valid-handle( g#lib-rwds ) <> yes then do:       run str/lib-rwds.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#lib-rwds ) <> yes then do:         message "Error starting lib-rwds.p" skip( 0 )           g#lib-rwds                        skip( 0 )           g#lib-rwds   :type                skip( 0 )           g#lib-rwds   :file-name           skip( 0 )           error-status :get-message( 1 )    skip( 0 )           return-value                      skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run lib-rwds_rcallfct in g#lib-rwds ( input              t-doc.doc-code ,
